#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following are only used if building the full package instead of only the"
" main libraries: <xref linkend=\"c-ares\"/>, <xref linkend=\"jansson\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"libevent\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://jemalloc.net/\">jemalloc</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"http://software.schmorp.de/pkg/libev.html\">libev</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://mruby.org/\">mruby</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://tatsuhiro-t.github.io/spdylay/\">Spdylay</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Os seguintes são usados somente se construir o pacote completo em vez de "
"somente as bibliotecas principais: <xref linkend=\"c-ares\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"jansson\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libevent\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/>, <ulink url=\"https://jemalloc.net/\">jemalloc</ulink>,"
" <ulink url=\"http://software.schmorp.de/pkg/libev.html\">libev</ulink>, "
"<ulink url=\"https://mruby.org/\">mruby</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://tatsuhiro-t.github.io/spdylay/\">Spdylay</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of nghttp2"
msgstr "Instalação do nghttp2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>nghttp2</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>nghttp2</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-lib-only \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/nghttp2-&nghttp2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-lib-only \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/nghttp2-&nghttp2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/nghttp2.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-lib-only</parameter>: only build libnghttp2. Omit this "
"switch if you'd like to build the example applications, Python bindings, or "
"the C++ asio library."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-lib-only</parameter>: constrói somente a "
"&quot;libnghttp2&quot;. Omita essa chave se você gostaria de construir os "
"aplicativos de exemplo, as ligações &quot;Python&quot; ou a biblioteca "
"&quot;C++&quot; &quot;asio&quot;."

